                                <p><p>Yeh majlis-e husain</p>

<p>He sog jis jagah bhi shahe mashrakain ka<br />
Khud pursa zehra leti he is noor-e ain ka<br />
Rona sawab jispe na rona haraam he<br />
chashme khuda me iska badaa ehteraam hai</p>

<p>Yeh majlis e husain alaihis salaam he<br />
chashme khuda me iska badaa ehteraam hai<br />
chashme khuda me iska badaa ehteraam hai</p>

<p>1. Ye majlise hai hamde khuda naat e mustafa<br />
in majliso me hota hai quran lab kusha<br />
in majliso se milta hai janat ka raasta<br />
in majliso ki hoti hai kuch aise ibtidaa<br />
zakir ke lab pe pehle khudaa ka kalaam hai</p>

<p>2. In majliso me hoti he insaniyat ki baat<br />
zikre gham-e husain he wehdaniyat ki baat<br />
yeh majlise rasool ki haqqaniyat ki baat<br />
radd karti he ye majlise sufyaniyat ki baat<br />
in ke sabab to hurr bhi alaihis salaam hai</p>

<p>3. In majliso ko ajre risalaat kaha gaya<br />
roze azal se rone ka fitrat kaha gaya<br />
dil ki lughat me isko mohabbat kaha gaya<br />
yani ise batool ke sunnat kaha gaya<br />
har rone aankh ko mera salaam hai</p>

<p>4. Ek majlise azaa jo huwi mulke shaam me<br />
zainab ne saff bichayi thi yaad e imam ne<br />
aansu chupe hue the shaheedo ke naam me<br />
matam huwa jo yaade shahe tashnakaam me<br />
tabse gham e husain zamaane me aam hai<br />
&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
5. Majlis me zikre bali sakina kiya karo<br />
pani piyo to yaad shahe karbala ki ho<br />
majlis me tazkera ali asghar ka jab suno<br />
ek aah sard bhar ke tadap kar yahi kaho<br />
Asghar bada shaheedo me tera muqaam hai</p>

<p>6. Is majlis e hussain ka sarwar hai nauhakhwaa&#39;n<br />
thakti nahi hai zikr e hussaini mein yu zubaa&#39;n<br />
ghutti mein ashk e ghum ko pilaati rahi hai maa<br />
walid ne di hai kaan mein nauho&#39;n ki wo azaa&#39;n<br />
rehan jisse saare zamane mein naam hai</p>

<p>chashme khuda me iska badaa ehteraam hai<br />
Yeh majlis e husain alaihis salaam he<br />
chashme khuda me iska badaa ehteraam hai</p>
